{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["RYO","Ryo is about the son of a samurai who lost his parents during the attack of English ships on a Japanese town who is given the name Ryo and becomes the bodyguard of Ryoma Sakamoto, a man who has his own plan to fight for the country.\n\n\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)\n\n\n\nNote: Ryo was one of the four films of Anime Mirai 2013 (Young Animator Training Project), a project funded by the Japanese government's Agency of Cultural Affairs in order to support training animators."],"ja":["龍-RYO-",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-14347","ids":{"shikimori":14347,"mal":14347,"anilist":14347,"kodik":"movie-49064"},"kodikIds":["movie-47291","movie-96071","movie-49064"],"kodikRevisions":{"movie-47291":"2020-01-07T18:41:04Z","movie-96071":"2023-06-29T20:08:11Z","movie-49064":"2020-02-09T00:27:31Z"},"title":"Рё","originalTitle":"Ryo","alt":"龍 -Ryo- RYO 龍-RYO-","description":"Рё — сын самурая, потерявший родителей во время атаки английского флота на японский городок. Он становится телохранителем Рёмы Сакамото , человека, у которого есть свой взгляд на то, как воевать за страну.","year":2013,"type":"MOVIE","genres":["Экшен","Драма","исторический","самураи"],"rating":5.8,"popularity":4412,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/14347/8ca9501f7e9b82e7551d375fb9c7d6ef.jpeg","width":423,"height":600},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/system/screenshots/original/79e35559eb4e249dd4e7eb78a44dae0dc49c49c3.jpg","width":1280,"height":720}},"releasedEpisodes":[1],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-609","dubId":"609","label":"AniDUB","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"movie-47291","translationId":"609","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/video/47291/51397edf59f8f6200bb247485b1cf86